msgid "Title block QET collection"
msgstr "图框 QET 收藏"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/title_block_qet_collection.rst:7
msgid ""
"The **QET** collection is the default collection from QElectroTech. This "
"collection is protected and the user can only read it, the **QET** "
"collection cannot be edited. The user cannot add or delete any `title "
"block`_ in the database."
msgstr ""
"**QET** 收藏是QElectroTech的默认收藏，此收藏受到保护，用户只能读取，**QET** 收藏不能编辑，用户不能在数据库中添加或删除任何 "
"`图框 <title block_>`_。"

